# Lighthouse — per-run HTML/JSON reports are regenerated by `npm run lighthouse` and heavy
# (base64-embedded assets); keep only the human-readable median summary versioned.
/lighthouse-reports/*
!/lighthouse-reports/summary.md
!/lighthouse-reports/summary.json

# Never accidentally stage the user's home Downloads folder
/Downloads/

